These are great UI adjustments! A minimal icon is much cleaner than a big "Upload Another File" button, and we definitely want that success banner to be soft, readable, and to properly disappear when you click reset.
Here are the specific blocks to replace in **JournalBulkUpload.js**.
### 1. Ensure resetAll clears the Success Banner
If the success banner is staying on the screen, it means setBatchCreated(false) was likely missing from your reset function.
**Find your resetAll function (around line 204) and completely replace it with this:**
```javascript
  const resetAll = () => {
    setActiveStep(0);
    setRequestId(null);
    setResultStatus(null);
    setValidationStage(0);
    setResultMsg("");
    setPreviewRows([]);
    setTotalRows(0);
    setIsProcessing(false);
    setAutoDlTriggered(false);
    setIsCsvFile(false);
    setIsErrorDownloaded(false);
    
    // --- THIS CLEARS THE SUCCESS BANNER ---
    setBatchCreated(false); 
    
    setFile(null);
    setSelectedDate(null);
    setPage(0);
    setDownloadMsg("Downloading error report...");
    clearInput();
  };

```
### 2. Update the Success Banner & Action Buttons
We will make the green banner much lighter with highly visible dark text. We will also replace the clunky "Upload Another File" button with a clean, sleek reset icon.
**Scroll down to the bottom of the file inside your return statement. Find the batchCreated && (<Alert... section and the <Stack> immediately below it. Replace everything from the Success Banner down to the closing </Box> with this:**
```javascript
          {/* NEW: Light, clean, highly visible Success Banner */}
          {batchCreated && (
            <Alert 
              severity="success" 
              sx={{ 
                mt: 3, 
                mx: "auto", 
                maxWidth: "100%", 
                backgroundColor: "#eef7ee", // Very light, soft green background
                color: "#1b5e20",           // Dark, highly visible green text
                border: "1px solid #c8e6c9", // Soft border
                '& .MuiAlert-icon': { color: "#2e7d32" },
                '& .MuiAlert-message': { width: '100%' } 
              }}
            >
              <Typography variant="body1" fontWeight="bold">Batch Successfully Validated and Submitted!</Typography>
              <Typography variant="body2">Total valid records processed: <strong>{totalRows.toLocaleString()}</strong>.</Typography>
            </Alert>
          )}

          <Stack direction="row" sx={{ ...actionButtonsContainer, alignItems: "center" }}>
            {/* Download CSV Button */}
            {batchCreated && !isCsvFile && (
              <Button
                variant="outlined"
                color="primary"
                size="large"
                startIcon={<FileDownloadIcon />}
                onClick={() => handleDownloadFile("SUCCESS")}
              >
                Download CSV
              </Button>
