                    }
                  }}
                >
                  <RestartAltIcon />
                </IconButton>
              </Tooltip>
            )}
          </Stack>
        </Box>

```
### What changed:
 1. **The Green Box:** Uses custom hex codes (#eef7ee and #1b5e20) to create a much softer, modern aesthetic where the text pops out clearly.
 2. **The Re-Upload Button:** It is now just the circular <RestartAltIcon /> button inside a Tooltip. It looks extremely professional sitting right next to the "Download CSV" button.
 3. **The Reset Fix:** Clicking the icon guarantees both the file clears and the success banner vanishes perfectly!
